This package does NOT contain lsfg-vk or Lossless Scaling.

lsfg-vk is made by PancakeTAS (https://lsfg-vk.dev) and licensed under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0. When asked to, DeckyLS
downloads the unmodified official release archive from https://builds.lsfg-vk.dev on the user's device, checks it
against a pinned SHA-256 hash and unpacks it into ~/.local, as lsfg-vk's own install guide describes. DeckyLS does
not modify lsfg-vk; it only writes lsfg-vk's configuration file.

Lossless Scaling is made by THS and sold on Steam; lsfg-vk uses files from the user's own installation of it.

